'''Wetwing''' is an {{Rarity|u|nolink = y}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Spawning ==
'''Wetwing''' can be fished up from water on [[Moonglade Marsh]]. It requires {{skl|fishing|level VII (7)}} or higher to be fished up.

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Wetwing''' is {{Green|2,875}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|28.75%|1|3.48|sea creatures}} with all [[Sea Creatures]] unlocked. Currently, there are no modifiers that can be used to increase its weight.

